<section class="page"><header class="page-head"><h1>{{ params.section }}</h1><p class="segment-render">this segment rendered at page render {{ renders }}</p></header><aside class="note"><b>Arrived by a link?</b> The navigator fetched this route's payload when the link was hovered and holds it for 30 seconds, so a second visit lands with the latency chart already in place and a payload never shows the fallback. Reload the page to watch the segment stream in after a second and a half.</aside><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Servers</h2><table><thead><tr><th>name</th><th>load</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for s in servers %}<tr><td>{{ s.name }}</td><td>{{ s.load }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></article><article class="card"><h2>Load</h2>{{ island(module="components/ServerChart.tsx#default", props=chart) }}</article>{{ slot(name="chart") }}</div></section>
